./ I 00428100 $ 00428150 010                                                    
         B     SETESA         SET ESA ON|OFF (M7)              XA0054DK         
./ I 00719000 $ 00719110 010                                                    
VMESA390 EQU   X'02'          VMFSTAT: ESA/390 MACHINE         XA0054DK         
* SET ESA ON|OFF.  ON TAKES EFFECT AT THE NEXT IPL OF A        XA0054DK         
* DEVICE (M7.8), SO CMS CAN SAY IT AND KEEP RUNNING.  ONLY     XA0054DK         
* OFF IS TESTED: THE SECOND ARGUMENT WAS SEEN AS 'KEEP'        XA0054DK         
* AFTER AN ATTACH TO THE USER (I-253, OPEN), AND ON IS THE     XA0054DK         
* ONLY USE THAT MATTERS.                                       XA0054DK         
SETESA   CLC   SAVEWRK5(4),=C'OFF '                            XA0054DK         
         BE    SETESAOF                                        XA0054DK         
         TM    VMPSTAT,VMV370R  SHADOW TABLES LEFT FROM AN     XA0054DK         
         BZ    SETESAON       EARLIER SYSTEM GO FIRST          XA0054DK         
         EXTRN DMKVATBC                                        XA0054DK         
         CALL  DMKVATBC                                        XA0054DK         
         B     SETESAON                                        XA0054DK         
SETESAOF NI    VMLCLRSV,X'BF'  OFF: NOT PENDING, AND NOT NOW   XA0054DK         
         NI    VMFSTAT,X'FF'-VMESA390                          XA0054DK         
         B     SETCOMP                                         XA0054DK         
SETESAON OI    VMLCLRSV,X'40'  ON: PENDING (DMKCFG IPLBYDEV)   XA0054DK         
         B     SETCOMP                                         XA0054DK         
